{"id":"n60487-1-12","stage":1,"title":"달걀 · 鸡蛋","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60487-1-12-1","ko":"점심으로 라면을 끓여 먹을까?","zh":"午饭要煮拉面吃吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"점심으로","meaning":"中饭，午饭，午餐","explanation":"점심：中饭，午饭，午餐；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"점심","audio":"/audio/12cf30d1ce4feda7a77d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70868","senseId":"1","lemma":"점심","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"점심으로","audio":"/audio/fc8de2bd84f44b4cb7e2.mp3"}},{"text":"라면을","meaning":"方便面","explanation":"라면：方便面；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"라면","audio":"/audio/6454befbdb61c843cbd2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62270","senseId":"1","lemma":"라면","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"라면을","audio":"/audio/360316f6f1e774bfbf4e.mp3"}},{"text":"끓여","meaning":"煮，烧","explanation":"끓이다：煮，烧；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"끓이다","audio":"/audio/e0e928624bcebfda14ca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59474","senseId":"2","lemma":"끓이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"끓여","audio":"/audio/c3f597952f4955107749.mp3"}},{"text":"먹을까?","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；을까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹을까","audio":"/audio/5376369aa2d708aa98ac.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"12cf30d1ce4feda7","term":"점심","zh":"中饭，午饭，午餐","audio":"/audio/12cf30d1ce4feda7a77d.mp3","entryId":"70868","definition":"早餐和晚餐之间，白天吃的饭。","pronunciation":["점ː심"]},{"id":"6454befbdb61c843","term":"라면","zh":"方便面","audio":"/audio/6454befbdb61c843cbd2.mp3","entryId":"62270","definition":"装有油炸干面和粉末状调味料，经水一煮即可方便食用的食物。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"e0e928624bcebfda","term":"끓이다","zh":"煮，烧","audio":"/audio/e0e928624bcebfda14ca.mp3","entryId":"59474","definition":"把食物放进水或液体里加热，制作食品。","pronunciation":["끄리다"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]}],"audio":"/audio/0d1ace52a01abb5dc4b8.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n60487-1-12-2","ko":"좋아! 달걀도 풀어 넣어서 맛있게 먹자.","zh":"好啊！再打个鸡蛋进去，一起吃得美味点。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"좋아!","meaning":"行，可以","explanation":"좋다：行，可以；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"12","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아","audio":"/audio/03b87f7121c91d1c28e1.mp3"}},{"text":"달걀도","meaning":"鸡蛋","explanation":"달걀：鸡蛋；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"달걀","audio":"/audio/09a20e31728b9d7aa86e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60487","senseId":"1","lemma":"달걀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"달걀도","audio":"/audio/eef3e774c9bc376302ad.mp3"}},{"text":"풀어","meaning":"化开","explanation":"풀다：化开；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"풀다","audio":"/audio/cada9014a11f228c9dfe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29761","senseId":"12","lemma":"풀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"풀어","audio":"/audio/5a537899b7ec8fb4557b.mp3"}},{"text":"넣어서","meaning":"放入，加入","explanation":"넣다：放入，加入；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"넣다","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64509","senseId":"2","lemma":"넣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넣어서","audio":"/audio/8df2d6ea7e8fdb45ade4.mp3"}},{"text":"맛있게","meaning":"好吃，可口，香","explanation":"맛있다：好吃，可口，香；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"맛있다","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70811","senseId":"1","lemma":"맛있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맛있게","audio":"/audio/07b7cf5b0007a8b257f2.mp3"}},{"text":"먹자.","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹자","audio":"/audio/2344faed1041c2fece65.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"行，可以","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某个行动或事情等不成问题。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"09a20e31728b9d7a","term":"달걀","zh":"鸡蛋","audio":"/audio/09a20e31728b9d7aa86e.mp3","entryId":"60487","definition":"鸡下的卵。","pronunciation":["달걀"]},{"id":"cada9014a11f228c","term":"풀다","zh":"化开","audio":"/audio/cada9014a11f228c9dfe.mp3","entryId":"29761","definition":"把东西放进液体里搅拌均匀或使之溶化。","pronunciation":["풀다"]},{"id":"c0bd6058bd724000","term":"넣다","zh":"放入，加入","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3","entryId":"64509","definition":"使跟别的东西混合或参杂在一起。","pronunciation":["너ː타"]},{"id":"21e91ac8a208ff9e","term":"맛있다","zh":"好吃，可口，香","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3","entryId":"70811","definition":"食物的味道好。","pronunciation":["마딛따","마싣따"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]}],"audio":"/audio/5ada3d17b11bc82f7345.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.12,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=60487","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":39,"sequenceScore":1.7734,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["好啊！再打个鸡蛋进去，一起吃得美味点。","午饭要煮拉面吃吗？","刚才我只是随口说说。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["午饭要煮拉面吃吗？","刚才我只是随口说说。","好啊！再打个鸡蛋进去，一起吃得美味点。"],"answer":2}]}
